// BT-4292: a subclass instance flowing where a GuardedDiffPoint is declared.
// Its tag names the subclass, so a guard on GuardedDiffPoint misses it.

GuardedDiffPoint subclass: GuardedDiffPointSub
  sum -> Integer => 1000 + self x + self y
